                <pb facs="0570" n="528" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg528"/>

                <head>[Copy.]</head>
                <p>I grant this request under the circumstances, thereby according to a confederate
                    steamer the same privileges which I have formerly granted to federal steamers.
                    But the irregularity in delaying to make this request should be pointed out, and
                    the pilot called on to explain how he permitted the Florida without my
                    permission.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. J. BAYLEY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
